orate). She also knows C is reliable, creates positive crew atmosphere, but difficulty communicating, egocentric, not willing to further education. She also knows C makes correct decisions quickly, calm in crisis, understands complicated technology (from James's notes). She may weigh B's reliability and stress vs C's decision quality and calmness vs both have communication issues. Also B's weak numeric memory is a serious safety concern. Sarah may shift to C.\n\nShe should reference James's point about numeric memory and nasty remarks, and also note C's strengths. She can adjust her vote to Candidate C.\n\nThus produce public message: \"I see James's point about B's weak numeric memory and nasty remarks, which are critical safety concerns. While B is reliable and stress-resilient, C's quick correct decisions, calmness, technical understanding outweigh his adaptability concerns. Therefore I shift my recommendation to Candidate C.\"\n\nProvide metadata JSON with vote Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
